{"4194710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pro Stone Curling", "steam_appid": 4194710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro Stone Curling is the most realistic curling game there is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Winter Games coming up, learn the rules of the game and the feel the thrill of making that perfect throw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game casually while you work, browse, or anything you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose your country and stone colour, upgrade your aim, curling and sweeping skills along the way playing a series of different teams along the way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play against a computer or another human (No online multiplayer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One throw challenges. Try and recreate famous curling throws to appreciate the skill behind it all. And some fun throws just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editor mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - See a curling shot in real life you want to try? Or just have a wacky idea? Set it up yourself and take a shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curlers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to see your team or clubs logo on or around the rink. Email me and I'll try to get it in an update ASAP!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro Stone Curling is the most realistic curling game there is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Winter Games coming up, learn the rules of the game and the feel the thrill of making that perfect throw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game casually while you work, browse, or anything you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose your country and stone colour, upgrade your aim, curling and sweeping skills along the way playing a series of different teams along the way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play against a computer or another human (No online multiplayer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One throw challenges. Try and recreate famous curling throws to appreciate the skill behind it all. And some fun throws just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editor mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - See a curling shot in real life you want to try? Or just have a wacky idea? Set it up yourself and take a shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curlers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to see your team or clubs logo on or around the rink. Email me and I'll try to get it in an update ASAP!</p>", "short_description": "Pro Stone Curling is the best curling game simulation.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194710/553df6009ce2e4ef929659ba784082b0ea363c0a/header.jpg?t=1765410276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194710/5c641d8e90e12723579d2e88488a08d495b2b15a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765410276", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194710/5c641d8e90e12723579d2e88488a08d495b2b15a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765410276", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong